OL,3,GNEWSAPaddington Bear leads famous
OL,4,Ailluminations parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaddington Bear has swapped his
OL,7,Fadventures in Peru for a trip to
OL,8,FDerbyshire and the 40th Matlock Bath
OL,9,Filluminations.
OL,11,FThe world-famous Peruvian bespectacled
OL,12,Fbear is leading the parade of 11 boats
OL,13,Fat the illuminations aboard a colourful
OL,14,Ffloat created by father-and-son duo Ian
OL,15,Fand Mark Page.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
