OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1789991763
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPaddington Bear leads famous
OL,4,Ailluminations parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan and Mark were presented with the
OL,7,FArkwright cup - provided by the local
OL,8,FArkwright family - and Centenary cup
OL,9,Ffor "Paddington's Adventure in London",
OL,10,Ffeaturing Big Ben, a miniature version
OL,11,Fof the London Eye and a traditional red
OL,12,Fdouble-decker bus.
OL,14,FDerbyshire Dales District Council said
OL,15,Fthe float would now have the honour of
OL,16,Fleading out the famous parade for the
OL,17,Fremainder of the 129th illuminations
OL,18,Fseason.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
